with zero-copy queues on 7.3+ (vendor/fuser/CONSTELLATION-PATCH.md, "io-uring"),
behind the `io-uring` cargo feature and off by default. Apply with -p1 in
vendor/fuser, after 0001-constellation-session-handover.patch.

